00:28:22.539 --> 00:28:24.539
I know I was right, Chloe.

00:28:24.539 --> 00:28:26.539
I really screwed up.

00:28:26.539 --> 00:28:28.539
Maybe not.

00:28:28.539 --> 00:28:30.539
There are a lot of drugs that could make Lex see pink elephants.

00:28:30.539 --> 00:28:33.539
Now, the question is, how did it get into his system?

00:28:34.539 --> 00:28:36.539
The mansion.

00:28:36.539 --> 00:28:38.539
Everything's brought to him there.

00:28:38.539 --> 00:28:39.539
The food, the drinks.

00:28:39.539 --> 00:28:42.539
So far, we know they could have been dosing him for weeks.

00:28:45.539 --> 00:28:47.539
How'd you do it?

00:28:49.539 --> 00:28:50.539
Do what?

00:28:50.539 --> 00:28:52.539
Get the drugs into Lex's system.

00:28:52.539 --> 00:28:56.539
You know, I don't appreciate some farm boy coming in here and accusing me of a felony.

00:28:58.539 --> 00:29:00.539
Don't underestimate farm boys.

00:29:00.539 --> 00:29:02.539
Bailing all that hate can make you pretty strong.

00:29:02.539 --> 00:29:03.539
Come on, man!

00:29:03.539 --> 00:29:04.539
You could have broken my arm!

00:29:04.539 --> 00:29:06.539
Not if you tell me how you drugged Lex!

00:29:08.539 --> 00:29:09.539
This is scotch!

00:29:14.539 --> 00:29:15.539
Tell me who you're working for!

00:29:15.539 --> 00:29:17.539
I don't know who they are, all right?

00:29:17.539 --> 00:29:19.539
All I have is a cell phone number.

00:29:19.539 --> 00:29:20.539
Then call it.

00:29:20.539 --> 00:29:22.539
And tell whoever answers to be at the Smallville Stables by noon.

00:29:22.539 --> 00:29:24.539
With a bag full of Benjamins, or I go to the cops.

00:29:24.539 --> 00:29:25.539
What?

00:29:25.539 --> 00:29:26.539
Kid, you're crazy.

00:29:26.539 --> 00:29:28.539
And these people are not gonna pay you off.

00:29:28.539 --> 00:29:30.539
They're gonna kill you!

00:29:30.539 --> 00:29:32.539
I'll take my chances.

00:29:33.539 --> 00:29:34.539
All right.

00:29:34.539 --> 00:29:36.539
Thanks.

00:29:36.539 --> 00:29:38.539
Thanks, Mike.

00:29:44.539 --> 00:29:45.539
Thanks.

00:29:45.539 --> 00:29:46.539
How'd you get in here, Lex?

00:29:46.539 --> 00:29:51.539
Well, uh, when people think you're insane and you're holding a rifle to their head,

00:29:51.539 --> 00:29:53.539
they, uh, tend to do what you ask.

00:29:53.539 --> 00:29:55.539
Put the guns down.

00:29:55.539 --> 00:29:56.539
All right?

00:29:56.539 --> 00:29:57.539
Sit down.

00:29:57.539 --> 00:29:59.539
Let's talk.

00:29:59.539 --> 00:30:00.539
Sure, Dad.

00:30:00.539 --> 00:30:01.539
I'm sorry.

00:30:01.539 --> 00:30:02.539
I'm sorry.

00:30:02.539 --> 00:30:05.700
We'll have a nice father-son chat.

00:30:05.700 --> 00:30:07.200
All right. Sit down.

00:30:07.200 --> 00:30:11.200
About, uh, how you and Morgan Edge killed my grandparents

00:30:11.200 --> 00:30:15.200
and, uh, how you're drugging me to make the world think I'm crazy.

00:30:15.200 --> 00:30:18.700
And, hey, why not do the whole thing on Oprah, you know?

00:30:18.700 --> 00:30:22.200
Spill our dysfunctional guts on national TV like regular families do.

00:30:22.200 --> 00:30:24.200
All right, Lex, I understand why you're angry.

00:30:24.200 --> 00:30:26.200
I found out the same thing as you.

00:30:26.200 --> 00:30:29.200
The slumlord that owned my parents' tenement hired Edge

00:30:29.200 --> 00:30:32.200
to blow it up for the insurance money.

00:30:32.200 --> 00:30:34.200
Just like you planned. No, Lex. No, Lex.

00:30:34.200 --> 00:30:36.200
No, they were my parents.

00:30:36.200 --> 00:30:40.200
No matter how badly they treated me, I would never hurt them.

00:30:40.200 --> 00:30:45.200
And I know deep down you don't want to hurt me.

00:30:48.200 --> 00:30:50.200
You know what disappoints me, Dad?

00:30:50.200 --> 00:30:52.200
All right, tell me.

00:30:52.200 --> 00:30:54.200
You hired pros to kill me.

00:30:54.200 --> 00:30:58.200
You always taught me if you want something done right, son, do it yourself.

00:30:58.200 --> 00:31:02.200
Lex, the person responsible for this is Morgan Edge.

00:31:02.200 --> 00:31:04.200
I know where he is.

00:31:04.200 --> 00:31:07.200
Believe me, we can get justice.

00:31:07.200 --> 00:31:10.200
Lex. Lex, listen to me.

00:31:10.200 --> 00:31:13.200
Shh. You ate the baby.

00:31:15.200 --> 00:31:17.200
It's Julian.

00:31:17.200 --> 00:31:19.200
Are you seeing Julian again?

00:31:19.200 --> 00:31:21.200
No, I can't take him when he cries, Dad.

00:31:21.200 --> 00:31:23.200
Julian isn't here, Lex. He's dead.

00:31:23.200 --> 00:31:25.200
No! No, Lex.

00:31:25.200 --> 00:31:28.200
You can't blame yourself for the baby's death.

00:31:28.200 --> 00:31:29.200
Shut up! I know.

00:31:29.200 --> 00:31:31.200
You didn't mean to hurt him. I know that. Shut up!

00:31:31.200 --> 00:31:33.200
Lex, it was an accident, Lex.

00:31:33.200 --> 00:31:35.200
Tell me where Morgan Edge is now!

00:31:35.200 --> 00:31:36.200
All right. All right.

00:31:36.200 --> 00:31:37.200
Now! All right!

00:31:41.200 --> 00:31:43.200
You have to be careful.

00:31:43.200 --> 00:31:45.200
Lex, please.

00:31:45.200 --> 00:31:47.200
Be careful. Please, Lex.

00:31:53.200 --> 00:31:55.200
I can't bear to lose another child.

00:32:01.200 --> 00:32:10.200
Hello?

00:32:10.200 --> 00:32:27.200
Tell me where to find the guy you're working for. I keep squeezing.

00:32:27.200 --> 00:32:28.200
Where?

00:32:28.200 --> 00:32:58.180
I'm sorry.

00:32:58.200 --> 00:33:00.200
I'm sorry.

00:33:12.200 --> 00:33:13.000
Jameson?

00:33:28.200 --> 00:33:34.700
I gave you a chance, Edge, but you really screwed it up.

00:33:35.740 --> 00:33:36.559
Can I drop the gun?

00:33:37.039 --> 00:33:38.380
Your father's the one who screwed it up.

00:33:39.500 --> 00:33:40.580
You've done it my way.

00:33:41.360 --> 00:33:42.559
You'd be dead by now.

00:33:43.059 --> 00:33:44.140
What are you talking about?

00:33:44.380 --> 00:33:46.340
You really believe you could have escaped if I wanted to kill you?

00:33:47.059 --> 00:33:49.340
It was your father's idea to make you look crazy instead.

00:33:50.340 --> 00:33:51.180
You lie!

00:33:52.319 --> 00:33:53.160
It's true, Lex.

00:33:54.480 --> 00:33:56.299
Lionel's gotten soft in his old age.

00:33:56.299 --> 00:33:58.180
He was willing to lose.

00:33:58.200 --> 00:34:01.140
To lose his parents, but he said he couldn't bear to lose another child.

00:34:02.120 --> 00:34:03.160
Neck still bothering you?

00:34:04.319 --> 00:34:06.000
Muscle ache, sleeplessness?

00:34:06.480 --> 00:34:08.659
All common side effects of the drugs.

00:34:09.500 --> 00:34:10.760
I knew I wasn't crazy.

00:34:12.320 --> 00:34:13.480
Tell me how you did it.

00:34:14.559 --> 00:34:15.780
Lionel thought of everything.

00:34:17.199 --> 00:34:18.039
First the dope.

00:34:18.659 --> 00:34:20.099
Then getting the window fixed.

00:34:20.840 --> 00:34:22.260
Then setting up the sweatshop.

00:34:23.260 --> 00:34:26.380
All little details to push you over the edge.

00:34:27.320 --> 00:34:28.099
How do I know?

00:34:28.199 --> 00:34:29.199
You're the one who did it.

00:34:29.199 --> 00:34:30.299
It wasn't all you.

00:34:30.299 --> 00:34:31.500
Well, take a look around you.

00:34:31.500 --> 00:34:35.399
Do you think I'd be in digs like this if I hadn't cut a deal with your old man?

00:34:37.480 --> 00:34:39.679
You've got to admit, it was an elegant plan.

00:34:39.679 --> 00:34:41.439
Just like when he was a kid.

00:34:41.439 --> 00:34:45.839
Either you crack so completely that you can't form a coherent sentence,

00:34:45.839 --> 00:34:50.119
or anything you say sounds like the ravings of a madman.

00:34:54.339 --> 00:34:56.480
But he doesn't have to win, Lex.

00:34:58.199 --> 00:35:00.199
We can bring him down.

00:35:00.199 --> 00:35:01.199
Together.

00:35:01.199 --> 00:35:08.199
Maybe I'll just kill both of you.

00:35:08.199 --> 00:35:15.199
Hi, Cal.

00:35:15.199 --> 00:35:18.859
I had a feeling we'd see each other again.

00:35:19.919 --> 00:35:21.539
That's why I've been carrying these around.

00:35:24.879 --> 00:35:25.919
You know each other?

00:35:26.619 --> 00:35:27.759
We go way back.

00:35:28.199 --> 00:35:30.199
We've been friends for a long time.

00:35:30.199 --> 00:35:32.199
You're gonna miss too, Clark?

00:35:32.199 --> 00:35:33.199
You're in on this too?

00:35:33.199 --> 00:35:34.199
No, Lex.

