00:36:04.199 --> 00:36:25.879
Look

00:36:27.199 --> 00:36:31.199
You think you could just slither away from me, Clark?

00:36:31.199 --> 00:36:34.199
Lex, I'm your friend.

00:36:34.199 --> 00:36:36.199
I would never do anything to hurt you.

00:36:36.199 --> 00:36:38.199
