00:41:00.139 --> 00:41:01.659
By the time he finishes his treatment,

00:41:01.839 --> 00:41:03.599
he won't have any short-term memory left.

00:41:05.619 --> 00:41:07.259
Wasn't that exactly what you wanted?

00:41:08.799 --> 00:41:10.980
Never believed for a second, Doctor,

00:41:11.480 --> 00:41:12.980
that this is what I wanted.

00:41:13.819 --> 00:41:16.059
I love my son more than life itself.

00:41:17.879 --> 00:41:19.339
But he leaves me no choice.

00:41:21.179 --> 00:41:51.159
I love him.

00:41:51.179 --> 00:41:56.359
The only thing that's real

00:41:56.359 --> 00:42:01.399
The needle tears a hole

00:42:01.399 --> 00:42:06.500
The old familiar sting

00:42:06.500 --> 00:42:11.699
Try to kill it all away

00:42:11.699 --> 00:42:16.719
But I remember everything

00:42:16.719 --> 00:42:21.159
What have I done?

00:42:21.179 --> 00:42:22.359
What have I become?

00:42:24.359 --> 00:42:27.799
My sweetest friend

00:42:27.799 --> 00:42:32.980
Everyone I know

00:42:32.980 --> 00:42:38.399
Goes away in the end

00:42:38.399 --> 00:42:43.500
If I could start again

00:42:43.500 --> 00:42:48.599
A million miles away

00:42:51.179 --> 00:42:54.359
I'll keep myself

00:42:56.359 --> 00:42:59.359
I will find a way

00:43:21.179 --> 00:43:51.159
Thank you.

